    "enUS": {
      "description": "The pack has the name \"Ukor\" crudely stitched along the flap.",
      "dialogue": {
        "b3a0838f06edecbcf08c": "My pack! When I dropped it to run from that huge spider, I thought I'd never see it again. You really are a hero!",
        "e95502008259916fd9a1": "Something need doing?"
      },
      "summary": "Return the pack to Ukor in southern Durotar.",
      "title": "Ukor's Lost Pack",
